      "content": "GREAT MISSENDEN        AYLESBURY ROAD SP 80 SE 1/2                                                  (west side)                                                      Road Farmhouse GV                                                      II C17 altered and extended.  Timber frame cased in brick, front elevation rendered and painted.  Tiled roof to lower right hand section, slates on left.  Old brick stack in centre.  Two storeys.  C19 part on left incorporates part of older fabric. Central door in open gabled porch, cross casement each side and two similar to first floor.  Right hand section set back, one casement to each floor, small lean-to projection on left, modern gabled wing on right.  Rear elevation C18 brick, one old 3-light leaded casement to first floor.  Interior has exposed timber-framing with curved braces in wall and roof. Listing NGR: SP8849402780"
    }
